            [
              "kwh",
              "pf",
              "kwhdays",
              "cfactor"
            ]
          ],
          "notes": "Members are in TSpecSets order. The engine displays the billing set as kWh, kWhDays, CFactor, PF. Use one coherent family in a completed edit. AltDSS-Python new applies kwargs in supplied order. Set PF before XfkVA and AllocationFactor to allocate kW at that PF. kW/kvar derives PF. The engine requires Bus1 and kV for a model. The Python constructor can create an object with only its name.",
